# Build output for the Server VC++ project (root .gitignore covers *.obj/*.lib/*.exe/.vs/
# already, this catches the rest of what MSVC drops in x64/Debug|Release).
x64/
Debug/
Release/
*.pdb
*.ipdb
*.iobj
*.tlog
*.log
*.recipe
*.ilk

# Per-user Visual Studio debugging settings for Server.slnx/Server.vcxproj -
# local only (working directory, command args, etc.), not meant to be shared.
# NOTE: Server.slnx / Server.vcxproj / Server.vcxproj.filters themselves are
# deliberately NOT ignored - they need to stay tracked so the solution can't
# vanish again the way it did before (that was *.sln in the root .gitignore
# catching a solution file this project actually needed).
*.vcxproj.user

# Runtime player-activity logs (grows every run, not source)
Logs/
